## Optional — Bitcoin Archiving

Clone the Bitcoin archival layer:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/truthstamp-protocol/truthstamp-bitcoin
```

Follow the README in that repo. Requires a Bitcoin node or API access 
and additional Supabase configuration.

