## Optional — Run the Indexer

The indexer keeps your DB in sync with on-chain events:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/truthstamp-protocol/truthstamp-indexer
```

Follow the README in that repo for setup and env configuration.

---

## Differences From the Hosted Version

When self-hosting, you control everything:
- Your own contract — your proof IDs start from 1
- Your own Arweave wallet — you pay storage costs directly
- Your own user accounts — no shared identity with truthstamp.io
- Proofs from your instance are **not** visible on truthstamp.io

If you want your stamps visible on the main explorer, use the hosted 
platform instead.

